The ReSTIR story's RIS weights, pick, and W
===========================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 2's beat `c2-ris-math`, stage by stage as
`weightsStage` goes from 0 to 13: P's eight candidates in the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's
illustration; the same eight the next beats stream through a reservoir) in a table of their target p-hat, the
probability p they were drawn with, and their weight w = p-hat / p, each weight a bar beside its row; the pick in
proportion to the weights, on the weights laid end to end; the correction, the average of the weights; and W, the
average weight over the kept candidate's target, and the light at P, what it brings times W.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The candidates

The example's stream: the seed WRS's beat uses too (script/wrs.lam), so the candidates are the same.
$[# _seed 10]
The table's place, and the size of its text.
$[# _tableAt [% {v2 -4.4 0.5}]]
$[# _size 0.46]
The right column, where the formulas go.
$[# _right [% {v2 4.6 0.0}]]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], Table).
The table of the candidates: x_i, p-hat, p, w.
$[# {_table steps}
    [# header {'
        {tex "hx" "" _size textColor}
        {tex "hpHat" f"{\hat p}" _size targetColor}
        {tex "hp" "p" _size pColor}
        {tex "hw" "w" _size weightColor}}]
    [# rows {map
        {range 0 {length steps}}
        {^ {i}
            [# s {nth steps i}]
            {'
                {tex f"{x${str i}}" f"{x_{${str {+ i 1}}}}" _size textColor}
                {tex f"{pHat${str i}}" {short {.pHat s}} _size targetColor}
                {tex f"{p${str i}}" {short {.p s}} _size pColor}
                {tex f"{w${str i}}" {short {.w s}} _size weightColor}}}}]
    {tableShifted {table "table" {cons header rows} 0.11 textDimColor} _tableAt}]


Fn([Table, List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Float], List(Mob)).
Each candidate's weight as a bar to the right of its row, as long as the weight over the largest (stage 3 to 4).
$[# {_bars t steps s}
    [# top {fold {map steps .w} 0.000001 max}]
    [# x0 {+ {.x {.hi {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 3}}} 0.25}]
    {flatten {map
        {range 0 {length steps}}
        {^ {i}
            [# b {nth {nth {.boxes t} {+ i 1}} 3}]
            [# y {.y {boxCenter b}}]
            {growFrom
                {phase s {+ 3.0 {* 0.06 {float i}}} {+ 3.5 {* 0.06 {float i}}}}
                {filled f"{bar${str i}}"
                    {box
                        {v2 x0 {- y 0.16}}
                        {v2 {+ x0 {* 2.2 {/ {.w {nth steps i}} top}}} {+ y 0.16}}}
                    weightColor
                    0.85}
                left}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float, List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), List({kept: Int, light: Int, p: Float, pHat: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], List(Mob)).
The scene at stage s, its eight candidates and the first sixteen of the same stream (for "however many").
$[# {_scene s steps sixteen}
    [# n {length steps}]
    [# t {_table steps}]
    [# often {fold
        {range 0 n}
        0
        {^ {best i} {!if {> {.p {nth steps i}} {.p {nth steps best}}} i best}}}]
    [# weights {map steps .w}]
    [# total {fold weights 0.0 +}]
    [# kept {.kept {nth steps {- n 1}}}]
    [# keptStep {nth steps kept}]
    [# starts {runningSums weights}]
    [# u {/ {lerp {nth starts kept} {nth starts {+ kept 1}} 0.5} total}]
    [# columns {flatten {map
        {range 0 {+ n 1}}
        {^ {r} {flatten {map {range 0 3} {^ {c} {cellOf t r c}}}}}}}]
    [# wColumn {flatten {map {range 0 {+ n 1}} {^ {r} {cellOf t r 3}}}}]
    [# tableFig {flatten {'
        {create {phase s 0.0 0.3} {.rules t}}
        {write {phase s 0.0 1.0} columns}
        {write {phase s 1.4 2.0} wColumn}}}]
    [# pointed {pointParts
        {phase s 2.0 3.0}
        tableFig
        {' f"{p${str often}}" f"{w${str often}}"}
        accentColor}]
    [# ringed {!if {!and {> s 4.0} {< s 5.0}}
        {drop {circumscribe {phase s 4.0 5.0} tableFig accentColor} {length tableFig}}
        {'}}]
    [# weightRule {moveTo
        {texParts "rule" f"{\lit{1}{w} = \frac{\lit{2}{\hat p(x)}}{\lit{3}{p(x)}}}" 0.48 textColor
            {' "w" "pHat" "p"}
            {' weightColor targetColor pColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 3.3}}}]
    [# stripBox {box {v2 {- {.x _right} 2.2} 1.1} {v2 {+ {.x _right} 2.2} 1.45}}]
    [# segments {strip "shares" weights stripBox {' weightColor [% {rgb "#c4569a"}]} 0.03}]
    [# shareStrip {growFrom {phase s 5.0 5.4} {flatten segments} left}]
    [# ux {lerp {.x {.lo stripBox}} {.x {.hi stripBox}} u}]
    [# drop {smooth {phase s 5.4 5.8}}]
    [# pick {fadeIn
        {phase s 5.4 5.5}
        {append
            {arrowLine "pick"
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 0.9 0.5 drop}}}
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 0.5 0.05 drop}}}
                accentColor
                3.0}
            {moveTo
                {tex "pickU" "u" 0.36 textColor}
                {v2 ux {+ {.y {.hi stripBox}} {lerp 1.1 0.7 drop}}}}}}]
    [# rowBoxes {nth {.boxes t} {+ kept 1}}]
    [# keptRow {filled "keptRow"
        {fold {tail rowBoxes} {head rowBoxes} boxUnion}
        targetColor
        {* 0.3 {smooth {phase s 5.7 6.0}}}}]
    [# keptName {moveTo
        {tex "keptName" f"{y = x_{${str {+ kept 1}}}}" 0.44 targetColor}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 0.55}}}]
    [# asIf {moveTo
        {texParts "asIf" f"{\frac{\lit{1}{f(y)}}{\lit{2}{\hat p(y)}}}" 0.48 textColor
            {' "f" "pHat"}
            {' targetColor targetColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -0.55}}}]
    [# mean8 {/ total {float n}}]
    [# total16 {fold {map sixteen .w} 0.0 +}]
    [# mean16 {/ total16 {float {length sixteen}}}]
    [# corr {transform
        {phase s 9.2 9.8}
        {moveTo
            {texParts "corr" f"{\frac{1}{\lit{1}{M}} \sum \lit{2}{w_i} = \lit{3}{${short mean8}}}" 0.44 textColor
                {' "M" "w" "v"}
                {' textColor weightColor estimateColor}}
            {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}
        {moveTo
            {texParts "corr" f"{\frac{1}{\lit{1}{16}} \sum \lit{2}{w_i} = \lit{3}{${short mean16}}}" 0.44 textColor
                {' "M" "w" "v"}
                {' textColor weightColor estimateColor}}
            {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}}]
    [# corrAt {moveTo
        {texParts "corr" f"{\frac{1}{\lit{1}{M}} \sum \lit{2}{w_i} = \lit{3}{${short mean8}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "M" "w" "v"}
            {' textColor weightColor estimateColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}]
    [# brace {outlined "wRing"
        {padded {boxOf {flatten {map {range 1 {+ n 1}} {^ {r} {cellOf t r 3}}}}} 0.08}
        weightColor
        2.5}]
    [# w {/ mean8 {.pHat keptStep}}]
    [# big {moveTo
        {texParts "W" f"{\lit{1}{W} = \frac{\lit{2}{\sum w_i}}{\lit{3}{M}\,\lit{4}{\hat p(y)}} = \frac{\lit{5}{${short total}}}{\lit{6}{${str n}} \cdot \lit{7}{${short {.pHat keptStep}}}} = \lit{8}{${short w}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "Wname" "sum" "M" "pHat" "sumV" "MV" "pHatV" "Wv"}
            {' estimateColor weightColor textColor targetColor weightColor textColor targetColor
                estimateColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -1.7}}}]
    [# light {moveTo
        {texParts "L" f"{L = \lit{1}{f(y)} \cdot \lit{2}{W} = \lit{3}{${short {.pHat keptStep}}} \cdot \lit{4}{${short w}} = \lit{5}{${short {* {.pHat keptStep} w}}}}" 0.44 textColor
            {' "f" "W" "fV" "WV" "L"}
            {' targetColor estimateColor targetColor estimateColor totalColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -2.9}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {!if {< s 5.0} {'} keptRow}
        {pointParts {phase s 7.0 8.0} pointed {' "hp"} accentColor}
        ringed
        {!if {< s 1.0} {'} {write {phase s 1.0 1.6} weightRule}}
        {!if {< s 3.0} {'} {_bars t steps s}}
        {!if {< s 5.0} {'} {flatten {' shareStrip pick {fadeIn {phase s 5.8 6.0} keptName}}}}
        {!if {< s 6.0}
            {'}
            {pointParts
                {phase s 10.0 11.0}
                {fadeOut {phase s 10.8 11.0} {write {phase s 6.0 6.6} asIf}}
                {' "pHat"}
                targetColor}}
        {!if {< s 8.0}
            {'}
            {!if {< s 11.0}
                {append
                    {create {phase s 8.0 8.4} brace}
                    {!if {< s 9.0}
                        {write {phase s 8.2 8.8} corrAt}
                        {fadeOut {phase s 10.8 11.0} corr}}}
                {'}}}
        {!if {< s 11.0} {'} {write {phase s 11.0 11.8} big}}
        {!if {< s 12.0} {'} {write {phase s 12.0 12.8} light}}}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). P's candidates at stage `weightsStage`.
$[# risMath {: {^ {t} {_scene {weightsStage} {exampleTrace _seed 8} {exampleTrace _seed 16}}} Math}]
